WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.690
Wh-what's this?

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.200
What the...?!

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.210
Now, everybody...

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.750
...we've just witnessed
a major upset.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:58.970
Argo Gulskii of Neo Russia
has been soundly defeated.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:03.100
And he was defeated only
48 seconds into the match.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.720
His opponent, almost
unknown until yesterday...

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.930
...was the Nobel Gundam
of Neo Sweden.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.610
Domon Kasshu's
Gundam Fight match today...

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.740
...seems like it's going to be
quite stormy!

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.030
And now!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.830
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.920
Beautiful Fighter!
Dangerous Allenby

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.840
Argo, what was the reason
for your loss?

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.340
Tell us how you feel!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:44.930
You're blocking the way!

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.510
Get out of our way!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:50.230
Go.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:58.900
What's this?

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.280
A special issue.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:03.990
"Shocking Defeat!
Neo Russia Pummeled Mercilessly..."

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:05.660
"...by Allenby Beardsley
in Today's Match."

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.370
Hey, you're...

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.710
You don't have to be a reporter
to want to ask what happened.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:11.960
Domon.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.960
- How'd you get in there?!
- It's okay!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.820
I came to see you fight...

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.420
...but by the time I got here,
the match was over.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:23.510
How could this have happened
to a man with your skills?

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.100
I've been wanting to know
the answer to that as well.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.060
How could you lose to
an opponent like that?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.790
The results are what counts.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.520
I won't make up any excuses.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.480
But I will say this much.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.730
She is...

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.280
...that Allenby is dangerous.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.280
She's a lot like you.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.740
Like me?

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:44.990
What do you mean?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.450
You can never tell what'll happen
in a Gundam Fight match.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.710
My advice to you is
to be extremely careful.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.760
So, he gave you encouragement?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.180
Yeah.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.100
He told me to be very careful.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.180
Oh, wow.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.770
He really looks out for his friends.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.600
You guys!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.900
Hey! Over there!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.980
What do you think those
two are trying to show us?

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.830
Arcades look the same
everywhere these days.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.960
Battle Big Brother II!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.380
It's the most popular
simulation game now.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.170
You like these games, right?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.690
It's just like the Gundam Fight.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.690
It is.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.560
I was outmatched.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.770
All right!
You're the greatest!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:06.280
Hi, folks! The winner again
is the White Tiger player!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.780
Th-that makes a
total of sixteen in a row!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.910
A girl.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:21.920
Well...

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.960
So, how about it?!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.970
Anyone with the courage
to jump into the ring...

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.010
...and fight this champion?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.550
Anyone?! Anyone?! Anyone?!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:32.890
No one?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.020
You're done already?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.600
I was hoping somebody could
make this more interesting.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.770
How about a professional?

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.440
Domon!

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.940
That's more like it.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.070
That guy's a Gundam Fighter!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.240
The one who said he'd
sweep the matches.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.410
I think that's the King of Hearts.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.530
A-a Gundam Fighter?

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.620
W-will you accept?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.790
Sure. Why not?

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.710
But this guy's a pro.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.210
Doesn't mean he's good
at this game.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.630
Besides, this could be interesting.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.670
You heard it!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.220
Come on, folks! Bets are on!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:12.050
Hurry now!
The challenger is a real Fighter!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:16.020
White Tiger Blue Dragon

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.440
I won't go easy on you.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.280
She's not taking me seriously.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:30.360
Now!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.240
Battle Big Brother II!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.530
Ready! Go!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.160
Here I come!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.750
Sh-she's fast!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.710
You're kidding! He dodged me!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:50.050
Looks like I'll have to
take this fight seriously.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.220
Not bad!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.560
This guy's pretty good!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.740
A-awesome!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.660
Domon's serious.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.330
Who could that young girl be?

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.140
Rain!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.060
The machine can't keep up
with their amazing speed.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.350
I-it's going to explode!

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:57.530
Domon.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.000
Rain...

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:05.670
Let's go!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.060
Oh, no!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.140
H-hey!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:25.310
You're the first one who could...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.900
...actually fight at my level.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.230
But next time, I'm going to win
for sure.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.570
Yeah. Go for it.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:33.650
Bye!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:34.490
Wait!

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.030
So, what's your name?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.280
Allenby.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.240
Allenby Beardsley.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:41.870
Allenby, huh?

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.260
What?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.180
Did she say Allenby Beardsley?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.560
I see.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.350
So, she defeated Argo.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.920
Allenby Beardsley.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.000
Ensign of Neo Sweden's
Space Forces.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.340
She's well versed
in the martial arts...

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.220
...and to date has won
every one of her matches.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:39.470
Furthermore...

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:43.100
...she wins all of her matches
in under one minute.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.520
How about that?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.270
Having a Fighter like that...

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.060
...hidden from the limelight
all this time is surprising.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.310
Well, I wonder about that.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.030
There you go again
with your suspicions.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.990
With unknown Fighters...

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.990
...there's a tendency to judge their
ability, but overlook crucial facts.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.830
Are you trying to imply
that her victories are flukes?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.120
No, I'm not.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.870
All I'm saying is that...

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.580
...we shouldn't jump to conclusions
until we see her fight more matches.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.090
I see.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.840
Then, we'll arrange it so we can...

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.300
...check out her abilities.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:19.260
Who do you plan to
have her face next?

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:22.890
Isn't it obvious, Master East?

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:33.480
How about this?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.360
God Gundam, Domon Kasshu?

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:39.450
I find that match-up
quite intriguing.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:52.710
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:56.710
Allenby.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.630
I hear you went out
and caused trouble.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.720
I didn't do anything at all.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.050
Just playing games.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.470
You need to cease these
reckless activities.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.020
Do you know how much money
our nation has invested in you?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.190
I don't remember...

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:15.230
...asking anyone to make me
a Gundam Fighter.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.450
It seems your mental level
has substantially increased.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.950
Something interesting
happen today?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.120
Stop!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.660
Don't peek into my mind!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.580
Sorry.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.120
That wasn't my intention at all.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.230
Then, please...

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.460
I... I...

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.450
I'm not going to let
those guys control me.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:51.770
Because...

00:11:58.580 --> 00:11:59.610
Because...

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:00.940
Because!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.450
I-I'm sorry...

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.500
- You're that...
- You're that...

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.920
- Domon Kasshu!
- Allenby Beardsley!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.420
You're late, Domon.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.420
We started eating without you.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.430
Good evening.

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:26.390
It's you.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:27.890
Hello.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.890
There's no need to be shy.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.940
I've never been inside a junk.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.770
Why don't you join us for dinner?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.730
Huh? But...

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.650
Oh?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:49.700
This looks delicious!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.000
That was a lot of fun.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.210
I've never had so much fun
eating like that.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.510
Your day's been filled with firsts,
hasn't it?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.470
You sure it's all right?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.180
Staying out so late at night
like this?

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.720
Those people bore me.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.390
I mean, they see me as nothing
more than a Gundam part.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.480
Well, I doubt that.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.480
They're all your teammates.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.900
You all have the same goal.
To win.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.650
I have no true teammates.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:24.990
I...

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.860
...I lost my parents when I was
about the age of those kids.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.700
Ever since, I've been brought up
in the military.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.410
For the sole purpose of
becoming a Gundam Fighter.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.170
We have similar situations.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.250
But it's different now!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.250
I've a strong desire to fight!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.710
Because...

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.550
Let's settle our game in a
Gundam Fight, okay?

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:50.350
Yeah.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.890
I'd sure like that.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.860
<i>Today brings us</i>...

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.110
...<i>the much-anticipated match</i>
<i>between Neo Japan and Neo Sweden</i>.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.820
<i>Brought to you live from</i>
<i>the Victoria Peak Ring</i>.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.530
It's about to begin.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:13.790
We shall find out
how well she does.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.250
We'll go with Plan C, as always.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.750
Get off my back!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.540
I want to fight Domon using
only my true strengths.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.380
Otherwise, I'm not going
to fight for you again!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.920
Forget what she said.
Prepare the derivative wave.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.180
But we can't disrupt her
mental balance before the match.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.600
Let's watch to see how things go.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.600
Domon! Here I come!

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:36.850
Let's show them all...

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.810
...what an ultimate fight is!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.520
Here we go! Gundam Fight!

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.150
Ready!

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:44.770
Go!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.740
Nobel Hula Hoop!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.660
God Slash!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:54.370
Incredible!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.250
That's about one minute now.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.680
It looks like she's not using
those powers just yet.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.390
The powers she used to defeat me.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:22.950
It's a game.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.400
Those two...

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.610
...are enjoying this like a game...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.190
...as they test each other's abilities.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.280
Impressive, Allenby.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.610
Even quicker than before.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:35.030
I never had so much fun
in all my life!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.140
Look, Domon!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.900
She's shining...

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:43.710
That Allenby, who hates
the Gundam Fight so much.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.040
But this won't lead to victory.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.300
Let's go with our other plan.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.760
Activate the Prime System
at once.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.260
Let's wait for a minute, sir.

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.220
That was an order.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:08.570
What's wrong?!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.410
Wh-what's this?

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.580
That's the power she used
to defeat me!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.630
This subliminal system...

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.130
...draws out her latent
fighting ability...

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.180
...and bumps it up to 120<i>%</i>.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.300
When that happens...

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.350
...Allenby transforms into
an invincible Berserker!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.030
What is it?
What are these cold fists?

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.990
They've got no soul in them.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.710
How could these punches
even be human?!

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:22.430
Well?

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.520
How do you like
Allenby's fighting skills?

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.350
She can't win this bout.

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:28.190
Why not?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.690
A picture is worth a thousand words.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.570
Just take a look at that Gundam.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.610
Allenby...

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.000
No. This is just fine.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.330
After all, we've beaten
the mighty Neo Japan.

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:44.330
Wh-what the...?!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.290
What?!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.840
God Gundam's Hyper Mode!

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:01.300
Wait, Allenby.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.600
Try to remember.

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:08.560
This wasn't the kind of battle
we were aspiring to.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.400
Yes.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.150
We Fighters...

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.980
...only know how to express our
feelings through our fists.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.530
So, Allenby.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:20.740
Now that you're fighting
without your soul...

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.950
...I have no interest in fighting you.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:25.410
This is just boring.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.080
Domon!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.880
That's crazy! It's too dangerous!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.460
Nonsense! Do it now!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.590
Berserker Mode Full Power!

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.010
Allenby!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.440
Don't lose to her, Domon!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.320
Shuffle Crest...

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:00.400
...please use your power to bring
Allenby's soul back to her fists!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.700
Please!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.170
Erupting...

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:20.050
...God Finger!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.430
Allenby!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.890
Y-you're right, Domon.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.360
This kind of fight is wrong.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.520
It's wrong.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:40.780
What?!

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.870
The inducement device
burned out.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.170
Domon!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:01.970
Th-the mountain!
What about the match?

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.550
I can't see the Gundams!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.470
Those two won't perish.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.230
Is it a double knockout?

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.060
No, he's standing.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.520
God Gundam's standing!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:22.530
Look! Allenby, too!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.490
I can't end it like this.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.920
You finally returned
to normal.

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:34.920
I'm sorry.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.500
It started off as a great Fight,
but...

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.500
No. It's only starting.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.130
Our fight begins now.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.340
Then...

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.800
...are you still willing
to fight against me?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.010
Of course.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:47.470
I challenge you!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:53.140
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.600
Its loud roar tells me...

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.230
...to grasp victory!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.280
Allenby!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:02.900
Domon!

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:12.700
Domon!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.920
Allenby? Are you okay?

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.260
Yeah, but...

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:25.130
...I'm really exhausted now.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.390
So please let me sleep for a bit.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:29.850
Yeah.

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.470
Rest as long as you want.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.060
Thanks a lot.

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.360
Did you see that, sir?

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:44.920
Before we realized it,
she was already out of our hands...

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.550
...and had grown up
into an impressive Fighter.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:48.570
Yes.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.080
We no longer have any use
for this Berserker System.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:55.530
I take back what I said.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.500
Allenby Beardsley...

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.500
...with a little polishing,
she could really be something.

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:04.130
One more thing to get
all excited about.

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:05.340
Right, Domon?

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.820
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:43.800
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.430 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:17.330
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:26.170
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:36.010
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:37.600
Chibodee's next opponent...

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:40.100
...is Jester Gundam,
piloted by a clown.

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:42.150
This jester taunts Chibodee...

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:44.020
...with his mockery and
creepy laugh.

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:44.650
However...

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.730
...his crew brings out a
song from his past...

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:49.780
...that gives Chibodee
the courage he needs!

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:52.110
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:56.240
Dazzling Power of the Clown!
Get Mad, Gundam Maxter!

00:23:54.370 --> 00:24:01.100
Dazzling Power of the Clown!
Get Mad, Gundam Maxter!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.660
Ready! Go!
